"\"use strict\";Object.defineProperty(exports,\"__esModule\",{value:true});Object.defineProperty(exports,\"default\",{enumerable:true,get:function(){return MDXContent}});function _extends(){_extends=Object.assign||function(target){for(var i=1;i<arguments.length;i++){var source=arguments[i];for(var key in source){if(Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(source,key)){target[key]=source[key]}}}return target};return _extends.apply(this,arguments)}function _createMdxContent(props){var _components=_extends({annotation:\"annotation\",br:\"br\",em:\"em\",math:\"math\",mi:\"mi\",mn:\"mn\",mo:\"mo\",mrow:\"mrow\",msubsup:\"msubsup\",msup:\"msup\",p:\"p\",semantics:\"semantics\",span:\"span\"},props.components),BlurBlock=_components.BlurBlock;if(!BlurBlock)_missingMdxReference(\"BlurBlock\",true);return Vue.h(Vue.Fragment,null,Vue.h(\"h3\",{align:\"center\"},\"I: We were always so good at meeting, and never thought about parting.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(\"p\",{style:\"text-align: center;\"},\"Beiyan Maple\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"We were always so good at meeting, and never thought about parting. When we happen to meet, and when we can write a story for it and leave behind a memory, we think there will always be time later. We never think that this might be the last time we ever see each other.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"The first and last time I met Elihuso was at a Saizeriya in Nanjing. I had come to Nanjing that day to meet a few trans friends, and by chance learned that one of them knew Elihuso. So I asked her whether she could put me in touch with Elihuso — I wanted to meet her, really just to fulfill a dream of meeting an idol. After getting Elihuso’s consent, I arranged dinner with her that afternoon. We planned to meet at the Saizeriya on Xinghuo Road, but my family had bought me an 8 p.m. ticket and insisted I go back. In the end, we could only meet for a moment at the subway entrance. We hugged, made a promise to meet again in October, and then hurriedly parted…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Elihuso was a very gentle, very good big sister. She had a kind of enthusiasm that could sometimes be a bit overwhelming, but never made you feel offended…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"There is actually a lot more I want to say… but I don’t know what to keep saying… I hope she can have a good sleep…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"R.I.P.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"May we meet again in the next life by the subway entrance on Xinghuo Road… and listen together to that one part of \",Vue.h(_components.em,null,\"These Days of East Beijing Road\"),\".\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(\"h3\",{align:\"center\"},\"Archive: A Letter to Everyone\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(\"p\",{style:\"text-align: center;\"},\"A Rabbit and a Kitten\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Since the beginning of 2025, Elihuso had been tormented by stubborn insomnia. She had tried many medications, yet it was hard to obtain true peace.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Later, she tried medications that seemed to her more effective, and also more dangerous. For a time, this rekindled her hope, but the accompanying problem of drug dependence also deepened step by step.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"In the long struggle with her physical problems, her friends never left her. They did their best to help her control her drug use, to ease her sleep problems, and they even took her to see doctors in search of safer treatment. Yet her own resolve remained as it was. As she once told us, what she was doing was not simply out of a wish to “control” her condition, but was “heading all the way towards the abyss.”\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Finally, on July 15 of this year, an accident occurred during her use of medication, and her fragile body could no longer bear it. During the subsequent resuscitation, she experienced respiratory depression and cardiopulmonary arrest. Although she recovered somewhat in later treatment, the damage from severe cerebral hypoxia eventually became irreversible. Her parents, upon hearing the news, came to Nanjing to help care for her, and in early August they brought her back to Hebei for treatment. The effects of complications began to worsen at the end of August.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"During this time of torment, we thought about the things from when she was still by our side:\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Since the end of 2022, Elihuso had endured a great deal. She lost someone she loved, and she lost hope in many parts of the world.\\nAlthough people tried to stay with her, wanting to lead her towards the light, she advised us that there was “really no need to put your energy into her.”\\nAnd yet she truly gave us so much warmth: she often thought of others, brought hope to others, and even on her darkest days kept the kindness that belonged to her.\\nAt the same time, we know well that she also had a sharp and authentic side, one that would even hurt others for the sake of what she held to in her heart.\\nWe still cannot tell right from wrong in all of it. It is simply that these two sides of her character were always one.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Even though we always awaited the arrival of a miracle, the absence of miracles is itself one of the reasons we call them miracles.\\nIn late September, after a long and stubborn struggle of her fading consciousness, she finally died of complications, and in that abyss she had once overlooked, she was reunited with Ani and other companions whom she had once deeply loved and lost.\\nBut beyond her departure itself, we deeply believe what she once said: that she hoped we would live well on her behalf.\\nThough she is gone, in this world she has already left, her truth and her goodness remain deeply engraved in our hearts, becoming strength for us as we continue to face this complicated world.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"May no one be troubled by sleep problems any more.\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"May everyone walk side by side with those they cherish.\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"May everyone still feel hope in this complicated world.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(\"p\",{style:\"text-align: end;\"},\"A rabbit and a kitten, who were once cared for by her and who also cared for her\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(\"p\",{style:\"text-align: end;\"},\"October 6, 2025\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(\"h3\",{align:\"center\"},\"Archive x: An Incomplete Letter\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"(You find this already broken letter among the piles of autumn leaves. Will you pick it up?)\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(BlurBlock,null,Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Elihuso:\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Your girl cried for a very, very long time today.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Crying because, even after trying for so long, your girl still couldn’t get you to try a path that might have worked.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Crying because your girl is still too weak, and still does not have the strength to save her Master.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Crying because, even though there is love between you and me, your girl still has to do something contrary to staying together.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Tossing and turning, tears exhausted, lamp burnt out, your girl finally thought: if it really comes to this, your girl may have to face a choice she does not want to make.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Today is July 10. If I’m not mistaken, █ will come over on the 15th, and you can still hug her for two days, and then go north. Your girl asks you to think it over again before the 18th: whether your girl should accompany you as you walk forward, or whether you still completely insist on your own path. There is no hurry to reply to me. I will wait until the 18th. But after that, even if you change your mind, it may be too late. (How can I even use the phrase “change your mind”? It doesn’t feel like something in Elihuso’s dictionary!)\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"If Elihuso still feels that society is already so broken that even your girl cannot give you enough light, your girl will also respect Elihuso’s choice. But there is one thing she cannot do: “to stand by and watch someone die.” This is what Elihuso said in █████████. Yes — for people with almost no connection to me, I can choose to let go. But Elihuso is someone in your girl’s intimate relationship, and someone she lives with. Your girl cannot accept watching Elihuso slide little by little towards the cliff of death right in front of her, and cannot bear the responsibility of choosing to let go at the critical moment — because she would regret it for the rest of her life.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"These words have been written over and over, and yet not sent. Because I still want so, so much to save you, but what your girl can do seems to have already reached its limit.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Your girl still cannot forget the belief Elihuso gave her, nor any of the things, physical or otherwise, you gave her. After you said those words that made her break down and cry, you asked her: “Do you love me?” Her answer was, of course: “I love you.”\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"I worked it out long ago: you want to use the same method Ani used back then, to drive away those close to you, and then die quietly without telling anyone, so that they won’t be as sad when you leave. Ah, such a method is truly “despicable.” I have seen similar tropes in literature too. By the time the protagonist finds out, it is already years later. Your girl is not that foolish. Your girl saw through it long ago.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"I am truly sorry (how stupid of me — I shouldn’t say sorry), your girl once thought you saw her as your hope in the darkness. Perhaps I misunderstood! Or perhaps your girl had been away from your side too long, and things had changed, and many things had made the heavy trauma accumulated in Elihuso impossible to shake any more. And so hope was lost.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Satou and Shio chose to die together, and I also thought of dying together with you. Shio in the end survived, and Shio became Satou. Shio may never understand why Satou let her live. But your girl understands. That is what hurts the most.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"If I had paper and pen in my hands, I am afraid tears would already have soaked the words.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"If, when we part on the 18th, your answer to me is still “let me go, do not save me,” then, after █ leaves, your girl will probably pack up and go back to ██. Because if I stay in Nanjing, by your side, I cannot keep enduring the pain of watching you head towards that extreme without being able to do anything, and then repeating the cycle of tormenting each other. I also do not want to argue with you or restrict you because of your drug use. Your girl has only one request: think more about yourself, and do not let yourself suffer too much.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"It is all right. Even from afar, we do not have to be “separated.” It is only that if my hands cannot reach the place where you are, at least in the end I can still comfort myself: “I have already tried my best.” But if I were by your bedside, and did even a little less of what I could do, in the end I would never be able to forgive myself.\"),Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"“Hikari Fatalis was able to find her reunion through the soul of The Initial Tairitsu, but in reality, your girl ultimately could not reunite with hers.”\"),Vue.h(\"p\",{style:\"text-align: center; color: red;\"},\"- A FATAL DECISION -\"),Vue.h(\"p\",{style:\"text-align: end;\"},\"Your Girl\"),Vue.h(\"p\",{style:\"text-align: end;\"},\"Written in tears and confusion, 2025-07-10\"),Vue.h(\"p\",{style:\"text-align: center;\"},\"(There seems to be a partially torn sticker of a catgirl holding her face on the letter. What it means cannot be made out.)\")),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"katex-display\"},Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"katex\"},Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"katex-mathml\"},Vue.h(_components.math,{xmlns:\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\",display:\"block\"},Vue.h(_components.semantics,null,Vue.h(_components.mrow,null,Vue.h(_components.mo,null,\"−\"),Vue.h(_components.msubsup,null,Vue.h(_components.mo,null,\"∫\"),Vue.h(_components.mn,null,\"0\"),Vue.h(_components.mrow,null,Vue.h(_components.mo,null,\"+\"),Vue.h(_components.mi,{mathvariant:\"normal\"},\"∞\"))),Vue.h(_components.msup,null,Vue.h(_components.mi,null,\"e\"),Vue.h(_components.mrow,null,Vue.h(_components.mo,null,\"−\"),Vue.h(_components.mi,null,\"x\"))),Vue.h(_components.mi,null,\"ln\"),Vue.h(_components.mo,null,\"⁡\"),Vue.h(_components.mi,null,\"x\"),Vue.h(_components.mi,{mathvariant:\"normal\"},\"d\"),Vue.h(_components.mi,null,\"x\")),Vue.h(_components.annotation,{encoding:\"application/x-tex\"},\"-\\\\int_0^{+\\\\infty}e^{-x}\\\\ln x\\\\mathrm dx\")))),Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"katex-html\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"},Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"base\"},Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"strut\",style:{height:\"2.4332em\",verticalAlign:\"-0.9119em\"}}),Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"mord\"},\"−\"),Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"mspace\",style:{marginRight:\"0.1667em\"}}),Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"mop\"},Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"mop op-symbol large-op\",style:{marginRight:\"0.4445em\",position:\"relative\",top:\"-0.0011em\"}},\"∫\"),Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"msupsub\"},Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"},Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"vlist-r\"},Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"vlist\",style:{height:\"1.5212em\"}},Vue.h(_components.span,{style:{top:\"-1.7881em\",marginLeft:\"-0.4445em\",marginRight:\"0.05em\"}},Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"pstrut\",style:{height:\"2.7em\"}}),Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"},Vue.h(_components.span,{className:\"mord mtight\"},\"0\"))),Vue.h(_compone